
<div class="row mb-2 mr-1 ml-1">
  <div class="col mt-3">
    <h5 class="text-center">
      <i class="fas fa-briefcase"></i>
      &nbsp;
      Rent a room
    </h5>
    <div class="mt-3">
      Rent a room by the hour. Pay when you make your reservation. Reserve for today or sometime in the future.
    </div>
